{"2456120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Claw Machine Sim", "steam_appid": 2456120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Simulated Physics<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456120/extras/6ca1222dc9c3ca5628b04c9b06f93da5.poster.avif?t=1786149609\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456120/extras/6ca1222dc9c3ca5628b04c9b06f93da5.webm?t=1786149609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456120/extras/6ca1222dc9c3ca5628b04c9b06f93da5.mp4?t=1786149609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fully simulated claw machine physics. Everything interacts as it should, nothing is faked. You can choose between <strong>fun</strong> and <strong>realistic</strong> difficulty mode.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect them all!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456120/extras/b41999d6928575331eb86061e034ebc7.poster.avif?t=1786149609\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456120/extras/b41999d6928575331eb86061e034ebc7.webm?t=1786149609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456120/extras/b41999d6928575331eb86061e034ebc7.mp4?t=1786149609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Win over <strong>200+ unique prizes</strong> in the claw machine and inspect their detailed 3D visuals! Sometimes <strong>Special Prizes</strong> appear in the machine, catch them in 3 tries or they will disappear again. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456120/extras/32cb69663f7d31ccb9ad04246b75278c.poster.avif?t=1786149609\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456120/extras/32cb69663f7d31ccb9ad04246b75278c.webm?t=1786149609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456120/extras/32cb69663f7d31ccb9ad04246b75278c.mp4?t=1786149609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Want to add a little personal touch to the arcade? You can <strong>import any image</strong> to replace the poster next to the machine. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Simulated Physics<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456120/extras/6ca1222dc9c3ca5628b04c9b06f93da5.poster.avif?t=1786149609\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456120/extras/6ca1222dc9c3ca5628b04c9b06f93da5.webm?t=1786149609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456120/extras/6ca1222dc9c3ca5628b04c9b06f93da5.mp4?t=1786149609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fully simulated claw machine physics. Everything interacts as it should, nothing is faked. You can choose between <strong>fun</strong> and <strong>realistic</strong> difficulty mode.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect them all!</h2><p class